commit f86290673d752c77b56c70228c3d26aced75e177
Author:     Jakub Skokan <jakub.skokan@havefun.cz>
AuthorDate: Fri Oct 23 21:27:37 2026 +0200
Commit:     Jakub Skokan <jakub.skokan@havefun.cz>
CommitDate: Fri Oct 23 21:27:37 2026 +0200

    conversation: add optional retry activity notices and actions
    
    Expose safe retry-chain observations through an optional provider and token-only
    Now and Stop routes. Resolve trusted conversation authority for every call and
    retain the existing origin, payload and mutation-lock boundaries. Keep legacy
    retry providers and the required App Server client interface unchanged.
    
    Offer a reusable footer notice with confirmed starts, uncertain submissions,
    server-relative countdowns and honest elapsed-time quality through execution
    and frozen results. Dismiss each exact conversation and chain locally, including
    when browser storage is unavailable. Coalesce observations and reconcile lost
    action responses by reading; the browser never dispatches a continuation.
    
    Applications own scheduling, durable policy, cancellation and transcript scroll
    behavior. Native protocols and submission formats are unchanged.

commit 55e0300b27b6927b1693b3792042762f31a385cc
Author:     Jakub Skokan <jakub.skokan@havefun.cz>
AuthorDate: Fri Oct 23 22:05:04 2026 +0200
Commit:     Jakub Skokan <jakub.skokan@havefun.cz>
CommitDate: Fri Oct 23 22:05:04 2026 +0200

    conversation: submit question answers with Enter
    
    Activate each question textarea's existing submit button on plain Enter and
    retain Shift+Enter for newlines. Share the binding across optional inline and
    pinned questions and the pending JSON editor, preserving their validation,
    authority and exact delivery paths.
    
    Leave composition, modified shortcuts and option widgets alone. Suppress held
    Enter repeats and respect disabled, hidden and read-only controls. Export the
    small binding for applications with their own question forms; the main composer
    and durable sender are unchanged.

commit a58f07064c560bb30efb0228ec6307bcd991d7ab
Author:     Jakub Skokan <jakub.skokan@havefun.cz>
AuthorDate: Fri Oct 23 23:16:39 2026 +0200
Commit:     Jakub Skokan <jakub.skokan@havefun.cz>
CommitDate: Fri Oct 23 23:20:20 2026 +0200

    conversation: use an icon to dismiss retry notices
    
    Place terminal retry dismissal in a separate right-side heading cell. Keep
    wrapped titles and metrics clear of the close icon on narrow screens, with an
    explicit accessible name and the existing keyboard focus treatment.
    
    Retain exact conversation and chain dismissal keys, local storage fallback and
    active Retry now and Stop retrying controls. No provider or delivery behavior
    changes. Version the child module URL so cached imports refresh the control.
